ur Story of Protection\",text:\"Since 2008, we’ve expanded what we do to protect you no matter where you go on the Internet. Check out our story.\"},{icon:ex,heading:\"We Hatched\",text:\"DuckDuckGo began as an idea for a better search engine experience. We hatched out of a few servers in a dusty basement.\",date:\"September 25, 2008\"},{icon:ew,heading:\"Launch!\",text:\"Within the year, DuckDuckGo was announced to the Hacker News and reddit communities. We made it out with only minor troll scars.\",date:\"September 25, 2008\"},{icon:\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",heading:\"Anonymous\",text:\"We decided to make a bold move and not track your search history. Tracking is creepy.\",date:\"March 15, 2010\",buttonText:\"2010\"},{icon:eD,heading:\"The Billboard\",text:\"We told the world “Google tracks you. We don’t.” with a billboard in their backyard. Hello, World!\",date:\"January 11, 2011\",buttonText:\"2011\"},{icon:ey,heading:\"Launched Charitable Donations\\xa0Program\",text:\"We rely on a lot of great projects to keep our wings flapping. So we started giving back to support new and innovative tech projects, strengthening our commitment to raising the standard of trust online.\",date:\"February 26, 2011\"},{icon:ez,heading:\"Team Member #1\",text:\"For years, our founder Gabriel was the only full-timer. Caine Tighe changed all that, coming on board as our first official team member.\",date:\"November 30, 2011\"},{icon:\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",heading:\"Headquarters\",text:\"We finally moved out of Gabriel’s basement into our fortress in Paoli, PA. It really looks like a castle!\",date:\"December 1, 2011\"},{icon:ed,heading:\"Redesign\",text:\"Our first major visual overhaul introduced a new design that made you not want to close your browser the second you saw our results page.\",date:\"January 16, 2012\",buttonText:\"2012\"},{icon:eL,heading:\"1 Billion Searches!\",text:\"We reached the incredible milestone of 1 billion anonymous searches.\",date:\"July 18, 2013\",buttonText:\"2013\"},{icon:eo,heading:\"Team Member #10\",text:\"The big guys have thousands more team members than us, and so everyone at DuckDuckGo is an essential member of the team. Welcome to our 10th team member!\",date:\"March 17, 2014\",buttonText:\"2014\"},{icon:eS,heading:\"Reimagined\",text:\"DuckDuckGo launches a redesigned search engine with a refined look and a focus on smarter answers. And, of course, we still don’t track you.\",date:\"May 19, 2014\"},{icon:em,heading:\"Safari\",text:\"Apple begins including DuckDuckGo in Safari, with the launch of iOS 8 and OS X Yosemite. Wow, cool!\",date:\"September 17, 2014\"},{icon:es,heading:\"Firefox\",text:\"Mozilla adds DuckDuckGo as a built-in search option to Firefox. Thank you! Do you think we’ll ever get into Chrome?\",date:\"November 10, 2014\"},{icon:eL,heading:\"10 Billion Searches!\",text:\"We concluded 2016 with over four billion anonymous searches served, surpassing a cumulative count of ten billion!\",date:\"December 31, 2016\",buttonText:\"2016\"},{icon:\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",heading:\"Privacy Beyond Search\",text:\"We extended our privacy protection beyond the search box with the launch of our new mobile app & browser extension, available on all major platforms.\",date:\"January 23, 2018\",buttonText:\"2018\"},{icon:ey,heading:\"$1 Million Donation Milestone\",text:\"We reached $1 million in donations to help support organizations that share our vision to raise the standard of trust online.\",date:\"April 10, 2018\"},{icon:eL,heading:\"50 Billion Searches!\",text:\"In the last two years, we've flown from 25 billion searches to a whopping 50 billion!\",date:\"June 20, 2020\",buttonText:\"2020\"},{icon:eo,heading:\"Team Member #100\",text:\"The pond’s getting fuller! With our 100th team member joining the flock, we’re adding more quack to our team spirit.\",date:\"July 1, 2020\"},{icon:eL,heading:\"100 Billion Searches!\",text:\"Over the past one and a half years, we’ve doubled our all-time searches to 100 billion!\",date:\"January 13, 2022\",buttonText:\"2022\"},{icon:eu,heading:\"Privacy on Mac\",text:\"We brought our browser experience to desktops and laptops with the launch of the DuckDuckGo Private Browser on Mac.\",date:\"April 12, 2022\"},{icon:eA,heading:\"Email Protection\",text:(0,F.jsxs)(F.Fragment,{children:[\"We launched\",\" \",(0,F.jsx)(\"a\",{href:\"https://duckduckgo.com/duckduckgo-help-pages/email-protection/\",children:\"Email Protection\"}),\" \",\"— our free email forwarding service that removes multiple types of hidden email trackers and lets you create private email addresses on the fly.\"]}),date:\"August 25, 2022\"},{icon:el,heading:\"Privacy on Windows\",text:\"We launched the DuckDuckGo Private Browser on Windows.\",date:\"June 22, 2023\",buttonText:\"2023\"},{icon:ew,heading:\"15th Anniversary!\",text:\"We celebrated 15 years of DuckDuckGo, now offering comprehensive privacy protections used by tens of millions of people to protect their everyday online activities, from searching to browsing, emailing, and more. \",date:\"September 25, 2023\"},{icon:eO,heading:\"Private Sync & Backup\",text:(0,F.jsxs)(F.Fragment,{children:[\"We introduced the ability to privately and securely\",\" \",(0,F.jsx)(\"a\",{href:\"https://duckduckgo.com/duckduckgo-help-pages/sync-and-backup/\",children:\"sync and backup\"}),\" \",\"bookmarks, passwords, and\",\" \",(0,F.jsx)(\"a\",{href:\"https://duckduckgo.com/duckduckgo-help-pages/email-protection/\",children:\"Email Protection\"}),\" \",\"settings between DuckDuckGo browsers on phones, tablets, and computers.\"]}),date:\"February 15, 2024\",buttonText:\"2024\"},{icon:ea,heading:\"DuckDuckGo Subscription\",text:(0,F.jsxs)(F.Fragment,{children:[\"We launched the\",\" \",(0,F.jsx)(Mq(),{href:e,children:\"DuckDuckGo subscription\"}),\" (formerly Privacy Pro) — our subscription service with VPN, Personal Information Removal, and Identity Theft Restoration!\"]}),date:\"April 11, 2024\"},{icon:\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\",heading:\"Duck.ai\",text:(0,F.jsxs)(F.Fragment,{children:[\"We launched \",(0,F.jsx)(\"a\",{href:\"https://duck.ai\",children:\"Duck.ai\"}),\" — a private way to access popular AI chatbots.\"]}),date:\"June 6, 2024\"},{icon:eT,heading:\"Investments\",text:(0,F.jsxs)(F.Fragment,{children:[\"We announced we're\",\" \",(0,F.jsx)(\"a\",{href:\"https://spreadprivacy.com/duckduckgo-investing/\",children:\"investing in privacy-respecting companies\"}),\" \",\"that are raising the standard of trust online.\"]}),date:\"October 23, 2024\"},{icon:ey,heading:\"$6M Mark in Charitable Donations\",text:\"To date, we’ve donated a total of $6.9 million in donations, reflecting our ongoing dedication to supporting organizations and raising the standard of trust online.\",date:\"December 3, 2024\"},{icon:en,heading:\"Subscription + Duck.ai\",text:(0,F.jsx)(F.Fragment,{children:\"We added a new benefit to the DuckDuckGo subscription — support for advanced AI models in Duck.ai.\"}),date:\"August 27, 2025\",buttonText:\"2025\"},{icon:ey,heading:\"$8M Mark in Charitable Donations\",text:\"For our fifteenth year of donations, we donated $1.1M to benefit 29 organizations that share our vision of raising the standard of trust online.\",date:\"September 30, 2025\"}]},[e]));return(0,F.jsx)(\"section\",{className:eE().stories,children:(0,F.jsx)(\"div\",{className:eE().inner,children:(0,F.jsx)(eg,{stories:i})})})}var eh=i(23572),ek=i(59638),ep=i(59980),eZ=i(74746),eU=i(32156),ef=i(63447),eQ=i(30030),ev=i.n(eQ),eY=(0,ek._)(Array(64)).fill(\"X\").join(\"\");function eG(){return(0,F.jsxs)(ep.A,{borderRadius:\"xl\",className:M4()(ev().card,ev().skeleton),children:[(0,F.jsx)(\"div\",{className:ev().image}),(0,F.jsxs)(\"div\",{className:ev().content,children:[(0,F.jsx)(Mc.A,{className:ev().title,as:\"h3\",level:\"lg\",children:eY}),(0,F.jsx)(Mc.A,{className:ev().category,level:\"xs\",children:\"X\"})]})]})}function eP(M){var e,i,t=M.post,I=t.feature_image,N=t.title,r=t.